<title>INDIA: Bombay exchange says to extend trade till 1600 hrs.</title>
<headline>Bombay exchange says to extend trade till 1600 hrs.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) on Friday said trading would be extended 30 minutes to 1600 hours (1030 GMT) after a technical hitch delayed the start.</p>
<p>The exchange usually starts trading at 10.00 (0430 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
